<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>LoofaryBot Dashboard</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>
<body>
  <nav>
    <div class="brand">🎁 LoofaryBot</div>
    <% if (user) { %>
      <a class="btn" href="/dashboard">Go to Dashboard</a>
    <% } else { %>
      <a class="btn" href="/auth/discord">Login with Discord</a>
    <% } %>
  </nav>
  <div class="container">
    <h1>LoofaryBot Dashboard</h1>
    <p class="muted">Bot online as <strong><%= botTag %></strong>. Manage giveaways, the honeypot anti-raid trap,
      the leveling system, and build embeds — all from the web.</p>
    <div class="grid" style="margin-top:2rem;">
      <div class="card"><h3>🎁 Giveaways</h3><p class="muted">Persistent giveaways that survive redeploys.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>🍯 Honeypot</h3><p class="muted">Instant kick/ban trap channel with a live counter.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>📈 Leveling</h3><p class="muted">XP, levels, and automatic role rewards.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>🖌️ Embed Builder</h3><p class="muted">Discohook-style visual embed editor.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
